abstract: "A retail-demand benchmark that scores whether a method recovers the causal effect of price on sales, with the download and scoring package and the reference models. License: Apache-2.0 AND LicenseRef-Dominicks-Kilts. The code is under Apache-2.0 (LICENSE); the brand maps in causaldemand/dominicks_brands/ are not under Apache-2.0: they are for academic research only, under the Kilts Center's terms for the Dominick's data (LICENSES/LicenseRef-Dominicks-Kilts.txt)."
